cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AIGC Detector: a local, explainable AI-generated-text detector"
abstract: >-
  An open-source AI-generated-text detector combining a zero-dependency
  heuristic engine (surface statistics, lexical markers, burstiness) with an
  optional ONNX int8 multilingual classifier. Runs fully offline on CPU; no
  text is uploaded anywhere. Includes document parsing (docx/pdf),
  invisible-character watermark detection, sentence-level highlights, and
  calibration support.
